 ```
 
+##### limit
+
+The maximum number of ranges to take from the header. Ranges after the limit
+is reached are ignored; invalid and unsatisfiable ranges do not count toward
+it. Defaults to no limit. Values that are not a number of at least `1` are
+ignored.
+
+<!-- eslint-disable no-undef -->
+
+```js
+parseRange(100, 'bytes=0-1,5-6,10-11', { limit: 2 })
+// => [
+//      { start: 0, end: 1 },
+//      { start: 5, end: 6 }
+//    ]
+```
+
